{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/\u52a0\u5165\u793e\u533a\u5427_EN_v002.png?t=1744615186\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/\u699c\u9996qq\u7fa4\u4ecb\u7ecd_\u780d\u4e00\u534a_EN_.png?t=1744615186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u2193 Get first-hand information about [The Lost Realm of the Back Room] here \u2193</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discord:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">X:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Youtube\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tiktok\uff1a</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">E-mails: <a href=\"mailto:wf66857773@gmail.com\">wf66857773@gmail.com</a></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/\u5173\u4e8e\u6b64\u6e38\u620f_EN.png?t=1744615186\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a [Puzzle game] + [escape room] Backrooms game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Developed by 7 teenagers who love the backrooms culture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/aaa.gif?t=1744615186\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/\u5173\u4e8e\u5267\u60c5_EN.png?t=1744615186\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A large number of missing persons occurred in New York City, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">which attracted the attention of the FBI. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FBI agent Tommy Sanderson was investigating a missing little girl </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and unfortunately fell into the backroom Level 0. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/222-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744615186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/level\u5c42_EN.png?t=1744615186\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game includes 6 levels, including Level 0~5 and Level Fun. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level is large and designed to be more difficult than the previous level. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level has different puzzles and mechanisms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are also secret levels that will take you to the secret ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/333-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744615186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/\u968f\u673a\u8ff7\u5bab_EN.png?t=1744615186\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game contains randomly generated mazes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As long as you re-enter the game , </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">the maze terrain in some areas will change randomly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have different gaming experience every time when you re-start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/extras/444-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744615186\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2999000?t=1744615186","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744615186","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999000/cc60c28ce573cfe57cd7df72056fdca480534ac7/c